<title>JAPAN: Shikoku Chemicals -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shikoku Chemicals -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.03		vs	   17.67</p>
<p> Operating	    1.06		vs	  951    million</p>
<p> Current	    988    million    vs	  820    million</p>
<p> Net		  464    million    vs	  372    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.28 yen	  vs	    5.84 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     64 million	  vs	  64 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shikoku Chemicals Corp a top maker of mirabilite anhydride.</p>
